<h2 style="color: #0F3725; margin-top: 0; font-weight: 800;">Courier Application Received ⏳</h2>
<p>Hello <strong><%= riderName %></strong>,</p>
<p>Thank you for completing your GoEatOne courier verification application! We have received your uploaded verification documents and personal profile details.</p>

<div class="highlight-box" style="border-left-color: #10B981; background-color: #F0FDF4; font-family: inherit;">
  <p style="margin: 0; color: #166534; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600;">
    ⏱️ Expected Review Timeline: Your documents will be reviewed by our compliance team within the next <strong><%= typeof timeline !== 'undefined' ? timeline : '24 to 48 hours' %></strong>.
  </p>
</div>

