</p>

<div style="margin-top: 30px; padding-top: 20px; border-top: 1px solid #F3F4F6; text-align: center;">
  <p style="font-size: 12px; color: #9CA3AF; margin: 0;">
    Questions or need help? Contact our courier support team at <a href="mailto:support@goeatone.com" style="color: #0F3725; font-weight: bold;">support@goeatone.com</a>.
  </p>
